1200 GOSUB 6300:BM$="Man: David. These two people you killed were not northern tribesmen. The\Devil King must witness the blood of the northern tribes!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1210 BM$="`Who is he,` David thought. `He knows about the northern tribes... Could he\be the Devil King...?`":GOSUB 5100
