1230 BM$="Man: Me, the Devil King? Surely you must know he lurks in your veins,\waiting to witness the blood of the northern tribes. What are you afraid\of? How could you cry out at the mere sight of commoner's blood?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1240 BM$="`That happened in a dream,` David thought. `Nobody else should know about\it... So this must be another dream.`":GOSUB 5100
1250 BM$="David: This is a dream, isn't it? There's only two men who always torment\me in my dreams... the King of the North and the Devil King! If you're not the\Devil King, then you must be the King of the North!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1260 BM$="Man: I am not the King of the North either. You are trying to convince\yourself you are inside a nightmare because you have killed two men, but I\assure you: this is reality.":GOSUB 5100:BM$="Touch these corpses! Taste their blood! Face the truth!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1270 BM$="David: Who are you?! Show yourself!!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1280 BM$="Man: Can you not tell? I am the man who longs to acquire the power of the\Devil King in order to kill the King of the North and live happily ever after\with Susanna. I am David.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1290 BM$="David: YOU are David?! Quit screwing around! Susanna loves ME! And I love\her! Why do YOU want to make her happy?!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1300 BM$="Man: Do you really love her as you claim you do? You do not feel love for\Susanna the sorceress. But I am you. I am the David who can love Susanna\unconditionally.":GOSUB 5100
1310 GOSUB 9050:GOSUB 6120:BM$="The man turned towards David. David looked at the man's face... He tried to\speak, but no words would leave his mouth. That is because that man's face\was the same face he always saw in the mirror.":GOSUB 5100
1320 BM$="Man: I am David. Unless the pathetic, cowardly David disappears, Eleno\Vision is going to disband.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1330 BM$="David: If you're David, then who am I?!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1340 BM$="Man: You are David, and I am David. The only difference is that I will never\stop loving Susanna, while your love for her is dying down.":GOSUB 5100
1350 GOSUB 6130:BM$="The other David approached him, holding a knife.":GOSUB 5100
1360 BM$="David was terrified by his other self. He tried to run away, but his legs\would not move.":GOSUB 5100
